  "body": "### Summary\n\nMigration lot LOT-071 (Phase 3 — engine / Gates): Third-party services: inventory (image rehost, AQ, Giphy…), data sent, owner, first-use notices, configuration (Q-4, ADR 0007).\n\n### Scope\n\nThird-party services: inventory (image rehost, AQ, Giphy…), data sent, owner, first-use notices, configuration (Q-4, ADR 0007)\n\n- Module: docs · Difficulty: easy · Priority: medium\n- Audit source: review Q-4\n\n### Depends on\n\n—\n\n### Model\n\nOpus → Fable\n\n### Spec\n\n- [docs/lots/LOT-071-third-party-services.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/lots/LOT-071-third-party-services.md)\n\n### PRs\n\n- [ezzz/HFRnow#27](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/27) — LOT-071: third-party services inventory and image-loading decision (merged; work)\n- [ezzz/HFRnow#26](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/26) — chore(lots): claim wave 2 (LOT-031 (#58), 044, 071) (merged; claim/bookkeeping)\n\n### Old issue (frozen)\n\n[francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#91](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/issues/91) — read-only history.\n\n### Owner / session\n\nHistorical owner: mac/w2-071-opus (2026-10-27)\n\n### Pending captures\n\n- CAP-reho-st-image-fetched-cookie-less (#134)\n\n(Rows of the Mac capture backlog that name this lot.)\n\n### Status note\n\n`docs/LOTS.md` status cell on 2026-10-27: `done (#27)`.\n",
